DESCRIPTION:Through a variety of imaginative projects and creative techni
 ques\, this deliciously creative week of camp encourages playful experime
 ntation and sensory exploration. By the end of the week\, campers will ha
 veayummycollectionofone-of-a-kind artworksand a fresh perspectiveon the c
 reative uses of food.  Art lessons and activities are thoughtfully design
 ed and led by our licensed art educator.  Drop-off and pick-up informatio
 n will be shared via email after registration.12-3 pm Monday - Friday.
