BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Eskenazi Museum of Art
DTSTART:20260723T180000Z
DTEND:20260723T190000Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:Mindfulness at the Museum
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum and mentally recenter by making art or 
 journaling\, and make some time to check in with yourself!  Join us for a
  therapist-selected art activity meant to help you feel more balanced and
  in control. No prior skills needed\, just bring your heart and mind.  Th
 is group meets Thursday from 2–3 p.m.\, excluding holidays and museum c
 losures. Meetings are held in the Atrium of the Sidney and Lois Eskenazi 
 Museum of Art. Food and beverages are permitted in the atrium\, so partic
 ipants are welcome to bring lunch.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us at the museum and mentally rece
 nter by making art or journaling\, and make some time to check in with yo
 urself!</p><p>  Join us for a therapist-selected art activity meant to he
 lp you feel more balanced and in control. No prior skills needed\, just b
 ring your heart and mind.</p><p>  This group meets Thursday from 2–3 p.
 m.\, excluding holidays and museum closures. Meetings are held in the Atr
 ium of the <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline curso
 r-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Sidney and Lois
  Eskenazi Museum of Art</span></span>. Food and beverages are permitted i
 n the atrium\, so participants are welcome to bring lunch.</p>
