LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
SUMMARY:Public Tour: Global Contemporary Art
DESCRIPTION:In this instance\, we'll look at Samuel Levi Jones' abstract 
 assemblages made with found printed and bound matter\, contemporary photo
 graphy\, and selections of contemporary art of a variety of media in the 
